B.aqs=new A.Sr(null)
B.a1J=s(["No account means there is no CommonsLens identity profile to leak, sell, or connect to your searches. Local pipelines and exports avoid sending your research workflow to an application backend. Direct, visible provider requests make the service boundaries inspectable, and the full source code lets anyone verify the implementation.","This does not make web use invisible: hosting, Wikimedia, map providers, and external sites still receive the requests described above. The privacy advantage is the absence of behavioural analytics plus data minimisation and local processing\u2014not a claim of total anonymity."],t.s)
B.cv=s([],t.hE)
B.aqt=new A.fO("5. Why this design is more private",B.a1J,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a3Z=s(["This policy will be updated when collection or providers materially change. The effective date below identifies the current version.","For a privacy question or correction concerning CommonsLens, open an issue in the public source repository. Do not include sensitive information in a public issue. Requests about data controlled by GitHub, Wikimedia, OpenStreetMap, or Esri should be made directly to that provider."],t.s)
B.arn=new A.kc("CommonsLens source code and issue tracker",u.Z)
B.a1U=s([B.arn],t.hE)
B.aqu=new A.fO("8. Changes and contact",B.a3Z,B.X,B.a1U,null)
B.a1T=s(["CommonsLens connects to Wikimedia Commons, Wikidata, Wikimedia-hosted media, OpenStreetMap and Esri map tiles, GitHub Pages, and external source or licence pages. Their own terms, privacy policies, licences, availability rules, and usage policies apply when your browser contacts them. CommonsLens cannot control their content or practices."],t.s)
B.aqv=new A.fO("6. Third-party services and links",B.a1T,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a2F=s(["CommonsLens does not load visitor analytics, tag managers, advertising pixels, telemetry SDKs, session replay tools, or behavioural-tracking services. The application does not send page views, searches, filters, file titles, downloads, clicks, map activity, device identifiers, or interaction events to CommonsLens or an analytics provider.","A static Google Search Console ownership-verification file is published with the site. It contains no script, cookie, pixel, or executable code, and it is not loaded by ordinary pages. Google may request that file periodically to confirm site ownership; it does not track visitors.","CommonsLens does not intentionally set tracking cookies. Browser storage used for application preferences, saved pipelines, and caches is described below and is not used to follow you across sites."],t.s)
B.aqw=new A.fO("1. No analytics or behavioural tracking",B.a2F,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a1j=s(["CommonsLens is a general research tool and is not designed to collect information from children. Because there are no accounts or direct submissions, CommonsLens does not knowingly maintain a child\u2019s profile. If a minor uses the site, a parent or guardian should help them avoid entering personal information in searches.","The site uses HTTPS, but no internet transmission or browser storage is perfectly secure. Providers may process requests in countries other than your own under their policies and applicable law."],t.s)
B.aqx=new A.fO("7. Children, security, and international processing",B.a1j,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a18=s(["These Terms apply when you use the CommonsLens website, search tools, map, media viewer, downloads, exports, or visual pipelines. By using the service, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use CommonsLens.","CommonsLens is an independent interface to public Wikimedia services. It is not operated, sponsored, endorsed, or warranted by the Wikimedia Foundation, Wikimedia Commons, Wikidata, OpenStreetMap, Esri, Google, or GitHub."],t.s)
B.aqy=new A.fO("1. Agreement and scope",B.a18,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a21=s(["A free copyright licence does not clear every possible use. Images and metadata may still involve privacy, publicity or personality rights, moral rights, trademarks, patents, cultural restrictions, contractual restrictions, sensitive subjects, or laws that differ by country. Commercial, advertising, political, medical, or defamatory contexts can need extra care or permission.","CommonsLens summaries, filters, warnings, and generated attribution snippets are conveniences, not legal advice or a guarantee that a proposed use is lawful. Verify the source and seek qualified advice when the risk matters."],t.s)
B.aqz=new A.fO("3. Rights beyond copyright",B.a21,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a2P=s(["The CommonsLens software source code is open source under the Apache License 2.0, except for third-party material identified under its own licence notices. The Apache licence permits use, modification, and distribution subject to its conditions. It does not change or replace the separate licences and rights attached to Wikimedia media or data displayed through CommonsLens.","These Terms may be updated as CommonsLens changes. The effective date below identifies this version. Questions or corrections can be raised in the public GitHub repository; do not post private or sensitive information in a public issue."],t.s)
B.arm=new A.kc("CommonsLens source code",u.Z)
B.arj=new A.kc("Apache License 2.0","https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0")
B.a2M=s([B.arm,B.arj],t.hE)
B.aqA=new A.fO("9. Source code, changes, and questions",B.a2P,B.X,B.a2M,null)
B.a2H=s(["Use CommonsLens only lawfully and in a way that does not damage, overload, disable, disrupt, probe, or interfere with CommonsLens or any connected service. Do not use it to infringe rights, distribute unlawful material, misrepresent authorship, evade access controls, introduce malicious code, or attempt unauthorized access.","You are responsible for your searches, downloads, exports, publications, and downstream use of any media or metadata."],t.s)
B.aqB=new A.fO("5. Acceptable use",B.a2H,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a1A=s(["This local data is not synced to a CommonsLens account or uploaded to a CommonsLens server. Pipeline query results are treated as fresh for one hour, but a local record can remain until it is overwritten, cleared inside the pipeline tools, evicted by the browser, or removed when you clear site data. Saved graphs remain until you delete them or clear site data."],t.s)
B.a1F=s(["Local storage: whether the asset viewer should preview web-optimised or full-resolution images, plus the metadata-only media download queue.","IndexedDB: saved visual pipeline graphs, node settings, positions, names and notes, plus cached Wikimedia query results and their public file metadata.","Browser and service-worker caches: application files, images, media, and map/API responses as managed by your browser and the providers\u2019 cache rules.","Downloads and exports: individual files, locally-created verified media ZIP parts and their per-part verification manifests, metadata-only CSV data, and exported pipeline definitions go to the location you choose on your device."],t.s)
B.aqC=new A.fO("2. Information kept only on your device",B.a1A,B.a1F,B.cv,null)
B.a3E=s(["To the extent permitted by applicable law, CommonsLens and its maintainers are not liable for losses arising from your use of the service, reliance on metadata or licence summaries, third-party content or services, unavailable or corrupted data, or your reuse of a file. Nothing here excludes a right or liability that the law does not allow to be excluded."],t.s)
B.aqD=new A.fO("8. Limitation of responsibility",B.a3E,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a3n=s(["You do not give CommonsLens a name, email address, password, payment method, or profile.","CommonsLens does not use visitor analytics, advertising, fingerprinting, session-recording, or behavioural-tracking services.","Searches go from your browser to Wikimedia services; map views request tiles from OpenStreetMap or Esri.","Saved pipelines, notes, query caches, and your image-preview preference stay in storage in your browser.","CommonsLens does not sell personal information, run ads, create user profiles, or transmit interaction events to an analytics provider."],t.s)
B.aqE=new A.fO("The short version",B.X,B.a3n,B.cv,null)
B.a3r=s(["Clear CommonsLens site data in your browser to remove local preferences, caches, and saved pipelines.","Use the pipeline Clear Cache control to remove cached results while keeping saved graphs.","Avoid the map or a particular layer if you do not want requests sent to its tile provider.","Avoid entering personal, confidential, or sensitive material into searches, URLs, pipeline labels, or notes."],t.s)
B.aqF=new A.fO("6. Your choices and data deletion",B.X,B.a3r,B.cv,null)
B.a1g=s(["CommonsLens is provided free of charge on an \u201cas is\u201d and \u201cas available\u201d basis. Search results, metadata, rights fields, translations, generated snippets, map positions, exports, and third-party APIs may be incomplete, inaccurate, delayed, changed, or unavailable. Features can change or stop without notice.","To the extent permitted by law, no warranty is made about accuracy, fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, uninterrupted availability, or preservation of locally saved data. Keep your own copy of anything important."],t.s)
B.aqG=new A.fO("7. Availability, accuracy, and warranties",B.a1g,B.X,B.cv,null)
B.a0e=s(["CommonsLens itself does not ask for or maintain the following:"],t.s)
B.a3F=s(["Accounts, names, email addresses, phone numbers, postal addresses, passwords, identity documents, or profile details.","Payment or financial information.","Your contacts, messages, camera, microphone, uploaded private files, or clipboard contents. The attribution tool only writes text you request to your clipboard.","Your device\u2019s precise live location. Map searches use coordinates or places you choose; displayed file coordinates are public media metadata.","Page-view or interaction analytics, a CommonsLens-owned server log, cloud database, advertising profile, data-broker feed, or cross-device identity."],t.s)
B.aqH=new A.fO("4. What CommonsLens does not collect",B.a0e,B.a3F,B.cv,null)
