B.arO=new A.oj("Privacy Policy | CommonsLens","Learn how CommonsLens works without analytics or advertising trackers, what stays on your device, which providers receive necessary requests, and what is not collected.","https://commonslens.github.io/privacy/",!0)
B.arP=new A.oj("Wikimedia Commons Map Search | CommonsLens","Discover geotagged Wikimedia Commons media with point, radius, and place searches, clustered previews, metadata filters, and downloadable results.","https://commonslens.github.io/map/",!0)
B.arQ=new A.oj("CommonsLens Docs \u2014 Search, Understand, and Reuse Wikimedia Media","Learn how to search, filter, map, inspect, bookmark, export, and reuse Wikimedia Commons media with CommonsLens, including what happens to your data.","https://commonslens.github.io/docs/",!0)
B.arR=new A.oj("CommonsLens Features \u2014 Wikimedia Search, Map & Export","Explore every CommonsLens feature: advanced Wikimedia search, Wikidata and license filters, map discovery, attribution tools, metadata CSV export, and visual data pipelines.","https://commonslens.github.io/features/",!0)
B.arS=new A.oj("Visual Wikimedia Data Pipelines | CommonsLens","Build no-code visual Wikimedia Commons workflows with 31 source, filter, set-operation, transform, preview, and export nodes.","https://commonslens.github.io/pipeline/",!0)
B.arT=new A.oj("Browse Wikimedia Categories & Subjects | CommonsLens","Browse Wikimedia Commons categories, templates, and Wikidata subjects, then use them in precise media searches with include, exclude, AND, OR, and subcategory controls.","https://commonslens.github.io/browse/",!0)
B.arU=new A.oj("Terms of Use | CommonsLens","Read the CommonsLens terms for Wikimedia media attribution, licensing, responsible API use, third-party services, and legal responsibilities.","https://commonslens.github.io/terms/",!0)
